      "content": "self-care feels like such a joke right now. a bath or a walk isn't going to fix the fact that my whole life is just waiting for death. honestly, everything feels so heavy and stagnant... sometimes i look at him and i just feel this intense envy. there's a part of me that thinks once he's gone, the only way i'll ever actually get some peace or stop this aching is to just... stop too. like the only real relief is to just be done with the whole thing.",
